  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_e612bad6a66943978d440605d53b20e2",
      "statement": "The docs site build is a two-phase npm script chain: a Sass theme compile (`build:theme`) runs first and is chained via `&&` before the Antora run in both `build:site` and `build:site:fetch`, so the theme compile is never skipped in the normal workflow.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L16-L20",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:997367c3c6ebef052d023dac5c4b0009dd22cb887195c0bf16a6d52e6f4434fb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_90a5719a43bb457e9696eb16f7c6f924",
      "statement": "`build:theme` compiles `theme/site.scss` (a `@use` aggregator pulling in vars, base, nav, doc, components, and other Sass partials) with `--no-source-map` and writes the result to `supplemental-ui/css/site.css`, so the compiled CSS lands in the supplemental UI overlay that Antora packages rather than in the theme source directory.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L17-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c38f0377c1c91c898b8fed68aecba9715b1891782b39798295232d405b110111:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://theme/site.scss#L1-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2b4779355adb04c234caac08facd309c758eef63b9df640a5a223cabcdebd706:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_df5c51d0a8b545c0afc4bf5fbf06c099",
      "statement": "`build:site` (`antora antora-playbook.yml`) and `build:site:fetch` (`antora --fetch antora-playbook.yml`) differ only by the `--fetch` flag; both compile the theme first and then run Antora against the same playbook, reading the same local content source, vendored UI bundle, and supplemental UI overlay.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L18-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ab42ece6b3eb3e901ce9467406737da1e59a50caed9550cff01117fdd2d0ffb3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_76d2f593fbc3493a99a196f95f7c0a18",
      "statement": "The Antora content source is the local working tree at `HEAD` (`url: .`, `branches: HEAD`, `start_path: docs`), so uncommitted edits under `docs/` are included in the generated site without committing to `master`; `content.edit_url: false` means the site exposes no edit links.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://antora-playbook.yml#L13-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3740c4248cef1209f6115242b5ffbd83b0215b2bba14e10d5240739a46d9f3d2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5ccae296cfc14c1982f451dd76ae26cb",
      "statement": "The Antora UI bundle is vendored at `vendor/antora-ui-default.zip` and referenced by `ui.bundle.url`, so a standard `build:site` does not download the default Antora UI from GitLab on every run; `ui.supplemental_files: ./supplemental-ui` layers the repository's own CSS, partials, fonts, images, and scripts on top of the vendored bundle.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://antora-playbook.yml#L21-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e6c11da243970fd114c1848c9817b5cb53d2b5508daf452132c88124ce509778:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://vendor/antora-ui-default.zip",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:af43ace86d98f4e76ebea77f1e1345d880a5ec3bf88ce002214cfb45726fafc2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0e3a9ed69df14c59aef827fbd3e972c6",
      "statement": "Kroki is the build's real network dependency: `asciidoctor-kroki` is registered in the playbook with `kroki-server-url: https://kroki.nmlabs.gr`, and `kroki-fetch-diagram: true` in `docs/antora.yml` makes the extension fetch and render diagrams from that Kroki server at build time into local image files; this fetch runs on both `build:site` and `build:site:fetch` because it is driven by the document attribute, not by Antora's `--fetch` flag.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://antora-playbook.yml#L26-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ed3d07bb6de976ad8a659c568ef4c552fedfd16c869300f24ad546eecbe47a9d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/antora.yml#L12-L12",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:986aedaca097a822fbd1fbdc2fe968492bedc7a0964db7fe6b8d570eb2e37ec7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_892df21c6c0145adbd6e7360e6e89b4f",
      "statement": "The `@antora/lunr-extension` builds a client-side search index at build time configured for bilingual English/Greek (`languages: [en, el]`) with `index_latest_only: true`, backed by `lunr-languages` 1.14.0; the generated site wires the search UI through the `search-scripts` partial, which is gated on `env.SITE_SEARCH_PROVIDER` in `footer-scripts.hbs`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://antora-playbook.yml#L43-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1ee6ee43716c5cecc0edd41ab6722934ecb1c4146bb0dacef3bef0a32e480af1:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L3-L11",
