        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://supplemental-ui/partials/footer-scripts.hbs#L4-L6",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7666ccb8ae658a075069b1c5f67424869e33852241255eaec0e0dad331a429b8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3748034844514962856e4e5e8cd57378",
      "statement": "Antora writes the generated static site to `./build/site`; the `preview` script serves that directory with `python3 -m http.server 8081 --directory build/site`, so Python 3 is an optional prerequisite for local preview; the published site URL is configured in the playbook as `http://carrental-docs.nmlabs.gr` and is used for deployment metadata, not by the local preview server.",
